      "strat_anger_crisis_rage_thought0_step1": "持續重複 5 分鐘",
      "strat_anger_crisis_rage_thought0_step2": "不要理會其他冒出來的念頭",
      "strat_anger_crisis_rage_thought1_name": "想著一位你愛的人",
