      "strat_sadness_high_body0_step2": "換另一隻手",
      "strat_sadness_high_body0_why": "當悲傷難以承受時，鮮明的感官輸入能把注意力拉出反芻迴圈。",
      "strat_sadness_high_body1_dur": "2 分鐘",
      "strat_sadness_high_body1_name": "雙側輕拍",
      "strat_sadness_high_body1_step0": "雙臂交叉放在胸前",
      "strat_sadness_high_body1_step1": "緩慢交替輕拍左右肩 2 分鐘",
      "strat_sadness_high_body1_step2": "保持自然呼吸",
      "strat_sadness_high_body1_why": "緩慢的左右交替輕拍（又稱「蝴蝶擁抱」）能給身體穩定的節奏專注，許多人覺得很安撫。",
      "strat_sadness_high_body2_dur": "5 分鐘",
      "strat_sadness_high_body2_name": "TIPP：冷水＋運動",
      "strat_sadness_high_body2_step0": "用冷水拍臉",
      "strat_sadness_high_body2_step1": "接著做 60 秒開合跳或爬樓梯",
      "strat_sadness_high_body2_step2": "最後放慢呼吸",
