      "strat_sadness_high_body3_name": "平躺在地板上",
      "strat_sadness_high_body3_step0": "仰躺在地板上",
      "strat_sadness_high_body3_step1": "感受地面穩穩支撐著你",
      "strat_sadness_high_body3_step2": "至少停留 5 分鐘",
      "strat_sadness_high_body3_why": "地板不會讓你墜落；全身接觸地面能啟動本體覺並自然放慢呼吸。",
      "strat_sadness_high_body4_dur": "5 分鐘",
      "strat_sadness_high_body4_name": "吃東西與補水",
      "strat_sadness_high_body4_step0": "喝完一整杯水",
      "strat_sadness_high_body4_step1": "在一小時內吃一點含蛋白質的食物",
      "strat_sadness_high_body4_step2": "需要時設定計時器提醒",
      "strat_sadness_high_body4_why": "強烈悲傷會抑制食慾與口渴感；脫水與低血糖會在數小時內讓情緒更加低落。",
      "strat_sadness_high_body5_dur": "4 分鐘",
      "strat_sadness_high_body5_name": "慢速方塊呼吸",
      "strat_sadness_high_body5_step0": "吸氣 4 秒、閉氣 4 秒、吐氣 6 秒、閉氣 2 秒",
      "strat_sadness_high_body5_step1": "重複 8 輪",
      "strat_sadness_high_body5_step2": "如果舒服，可以稍微拉長吐氣",
