      "fo_smf": "Single-mode fiber (SMF)",
      "fo_smf_detail": "Core ~9 μm. Only one mode propagates. Long distances (>100 km). Used in telecom backbones.",
      "fo_wdm": "WDM (wavelength division multiplexing)",
      "fo_wdm_detail": "Multiple wavelengths on one fiber. DWDM can fit 100+ channels — Tb/s per fiber.",
