      "maine_s_15_shorebird_species_plovers_p": "Maine's 15 shorebird species. Plovers (piping, semipalmated, killdeer), yellowlegs (greater + lesser), sandpipers (spotted, solitary, sanderling, semipalmated, least, dunlin), willet, turnstone, snipe. Mostly migrants; some breeders.",
