      "marine_debris_falls_to_the_sea_floor_c": "Marine debris falls to the sea floor continuously. Octopuses readily adopt human-made objects as shelter. Freitas et al. 2022 found 24 octopus species using litter in underwater photos from around the world. This is both opportunistic + a marker of pollution.",
