      "new_high_speed_imaging_neural_recordin": "Schmidt Ocean Institute released the first confirmed footage of a live colossal squid in its natural habitat. Its remotely operated vehicle SuBastian filmed a juvenile about 30 cm long at about 600 m depth near the South Sandwich Islands on March 9, 2025.",
