      "misconceptions": "誤解",
      "10_05mm_a_0_84mm_shift_in_one_generati": "在本實驗對觀測紀錄的教學近似中為 ≈10.05mm：僅僅一個世代就偏移約 1 公釐。這是人類首度在野生脊椎動物族群中逐隻量測並直接記錄到天擇的經典案例之一。",
      "10_pairs_of_structures_for_each_decide": "10 pairs of structures. For each, decide: HOMOLOGOUS (shared evolutionary origin — same ancestral structure even if function differs) or ANALOGOUS (same function but independently evolved — convergent evolution). The single most important inferential reflex for reading evolutionary trees.",
      "10_trait_pairs_same_origin_or_same_fun": "10 trait pairs — same origin or same function",
      "10_vignettes_for_each_identify_which_o": "10 vignettes. For each, identify which of six mechanisms is driving the evolutionary change. After picking, a coaching block names what makes this mechanism more likely than the others (and what would have to be different to make a different mechanism the right answer).",
