      "290_years_of_figuring_out_evolution_da": "290 years of figuring out evolution. Darwin gets the textbook spotlight, but he didn't do this alone — and many key figures (Wallace, Mendel, Margulis, McClintock, Franklin) were ignored or pushed aside in their time. Click any card to read more.",
      "2_beak_lab_10_min": "2. 🐦 Beak Lab (10 min)",
