      "for_unit_planning_pick_a_next_generati": "For unit planning. Pick a Next Generation Science Standard you need to address; see which modules cover it. Each module has its own NGSS list inside its 🍎 Teacher Notes panel.",
      "for_unit_planning_pick_an_ngss_perform": "For unit planning. Pick an NGSS performance expectation and see which modules address it. Includes AP Biology Big Idea cross-reference for AP Bio teachers.",
