      "reset_apply_antibiotic_auto_run_for_30": "Reset. Apply Antibiotic. Auto-Run for ~30 ticks. Watch the population crash, then rebuild from the few resistant survivors. By tick 30 the dish is mostly red.",
      "reset_auto_run_then_move_temp_slider_f": "將暖化速率設為 0.010 或以下並執行試驗。平均耐溫值會緊跟溫度曲線移動並略微落後。族群存活下來：它成功適應了。",
      "reset_dish": "↺ Reset Dish",
      "reset_pause_auto_run_drag_temp_from_0_": "將速率設為 0.050 並執行試驗，或一次將滑桿從 0.5 拖曳至 0.95 並自動執行。短短幾個世代內族群便會崩潰。滅絕。",
      "reset_population": "↺ Reset Population",
      "reset_set_hunt_pressure_to_0_2_low_bot": "Reset, set Hunt Pressure to 0.2 (low). Both populations stay at low speed — without selection pressure, there's no arms race.",
      "reset_set_hunt_pressure_to_1_0_max_wit": "Reset, set Hunt Pressure to 1.0 (max). Within ~10 generations one side often crashes — usually prey, since they're selected harder. Population recovery takes many generations.",
      "reset_set_mutation_rate_to_0_apply_ant": "Reset. Set Mutation Rate to 0. Apply Antibiotic. Population goes extinct — no resistance can evolve from scratch. Now set Mutation Rate to 0.15. Resistance evolves nearly instantly. Real-world: bacteria with higher mutation rates evolve resistance faster.",
      "reset_set_mutation_size_to_0_10_high_t": "將突變幅度設為 0.10，並重新執行在 σ = 0.02 時曾導致滅絕的速率（0.040 或更快）。如今族群幾乎每次都能存活：更多變異為天擇在每個世代提供了更多可作用的素材。",
      "reset_try_moving_the_slider_at_differe": "以不同速率多次試驗，直到取得一次存活與一次滅絕的結果。兩者之間的界線即為該族群的「適應容量」，「最佳存活速率」卡片會保留你的紀錄。",
