      "at_lunch_a_classmate_who_is_deaf_taps_": "At lunch, a classmate who is Deaf taps you and points at another student across the cafeteria who is alone, eyes wide, hands gripping the edge of the table, breathing fast and shallow. You don’t know if they’re having a heart attack or a panic attack.",
