      "energy_mv_kinetic_mgh_potential_to_des": "Energy = ½mv² (kinetic) + mgh (potential). To descend safely, you trade altitude for distance — letting drag bleed off speed. The flare converts forward velocity into a brief lift increase that breaks the descent rate just before the wheels touch.",
