      "use_your_browser_s_print_menu_cmd_ctrl": "Use your browser's print menu (Cmd/Ctrl + P) on this Resources page to capture the glossary as a one-sheet handout.",
      "usgs_national_map": "USGS National Map",
      "uss_maine_destroyed_in_harbor_investig": "\"USS Maine Destroyed in Harbor; Investigation Pending\"",
      "uss_maine_lost_in_havana_restrained_un": "\"USS Maine Lost in Havana\" — restrained until facts known",
