      "experienced_welders_with_navsea_aws_d1": "Experienced welders with NAVSEA, AWS D1.1 or D1.6 quals can apply directly + skip portions of internal training. Pay starts higher (Step 3-5 depending on experience).",
      "explain_how_amperage_voltage_and_speed": "Explain how amperage, voltage, and speed compose heat input.",
