      "self_shielded_fcaw_no_gas_needed_best_": "Self-shielded FCAW (no gas needed). Best for: outdoor work, field repair, wind-affected environments. Less smooth bead than gas-shielded but no gas cylinder to lug around.",
      "self_taught_certified": "Self-taught + certified",
