      "car2_tl_aria": "Career timeline for {value1}: {value2} stages from age {value3} to age {value4}. Bar height is representative base pay. The numbered list below the chart gives each stage.",
      "car2_tl_check": "Check the arithmetic: the stages run from {value1} to {value2} with no gaps, {value3} years in all. Born about {value4}.",
      "car2_tl_rate1": "{value1}/hr (about {value2} a year)",
