      "hi3_legend_to_weld": "Solid orange: transferred to weld",
      "hi3_model_note": "Constant settings and speed; the existing process efficiency is fixed. This diagram accounts for energy, not temperature or cooling. At one inch, energy in kJ has the same numeric value as heat input in kJ/in. Try doubling speed: the time and energy for this distance both halve.",
