      "me3_network_group": "Inspect a Maine welding entry route",
      "me3_network_intro": "Select a training-to-work connection, then follow it into the branching roadmap. This is a route schematic, not a geographic map or a list of open jobs.",
      "me3_network_title": "Find your entry route",
