      "met3_limit": "The lens shows peak-temperature changes, not the final cooled structure. Final phases and hardness also depend on chemistry, starting condition and the full cooling path. Grain sizes and phase fractions are illustrative.",
      "met3_marker_key": "Cyan ring = the surface inspection probe. Its microstructure lens is below the temperature graph.",
