      "pipe10_a": "Wall A · current stacker setting",
      "pipe10_area_ratio": "B ÷ A groove area: {value1}×",
      "pipe10_axes": "Left: wall A. Right: wall B. Both drawings use the same inch scale horizontally and vertically. The root baseline is at the bottom; each grid interval is 1/4 in. The vertical white dimension marks wall thickness.",
