      "pipe2_explorer_intro": "Pick a test position, then walk the electrode round the joint. Predict before you click: at each o'clock, which way will gravity pull the puddle?",
      "pipe2_explorer_title": "🪈 Pipe Position Explorer",
      "pipe2_go_bead": "One bead's physics: Weld Bead Lab →",
