      "qp_journey_t1": "The highlighted band crosses the weld and includes base metal on both sides. The cap is on top; the root is on the other face. This sketch shows the relationship, not a cutting layout.",
      "qp_journey_t2f": "For a face bend, the cap face becomes the outside of the U. The reinforcement is ground flush on the prepared specimen.",
