      "run_keys_h": "Controls",
      "run_lg_bead": "The bead glows white-hot at the puddle and cools to grey behind the torch; ripples point the way it travelled.",
      "run_lg_defects": "On the bead: black holes are burn-through, dark grooves along the edges are undercut, black edge lines on a narrow ropey bead are lack of fusion, pinholes are porosity, light dots are spatter.",
