      "safe2_fp_in": "{value1} ft from the arc, inside the 35-ft zone",
      "safe2_fp_intro": "You are about to weld at the station (★). Make the area safe: get combustibles out of the 35-ft (11 m) circle or under a fire blanket, shield the aisle, and place the extinguisher, the fire watch and the fume extractor. Drag items on the plan, or pick one below and use the arrow buttons.",
      "safe2_fp_left": "Move left 5 ft",
      "safe2_fp_legend": "★ weld station · dashed circle = 35 ft (11 m) · squares = combustibles · circles = safety items · grey strip along the bottom = the aisle · each grid square is 10 ft · ✕ = covered by a fire blanket",
      "safe2_fp_moving": "Move: {value1}",
      "safe2_fp_no_cardboard": "The cardboard is {value1} ft from the arc, inside the 35-ft (11 m) zone. Move it out, or cover it with a fire blanket since the shelf cannot move.",
      "safe2_fp_no_curtain": "Put the curtain between the arc and the aisle, within about 12 ft of the station, so people walking by are not flashed (OSHA 1910.252(b)(2)(iii)).",
      "safe2_fp_no_ext": "The extinguisher is {value1} ft away. Keep it in the hot-work area, within 35 ft, ready for instant use (OSHA 1910.252(a)(2)(ii)).",
      "safe2_fp_no_fume": "The extractor is {value1} ft away, but its arm reaches only about 8 ft. Its hood belongs within about 12 in. of the arc.",
      "safe2_fp_no_rags": "The oily rag bin is {value1} ft away. Oily rags light easily and can even self-heat: move the bin beyond 35 ft.",
      "safe2_fp_no_sawdust": "Sawdust is {value1} ft away. OSHA 1910.252(a)(2)(v) requires the floor swept clean for 35 ft: sweep (move) it out.",
      "safe2_fp_no_solvent": "The solvent can is {value1} ft away. A flammable liquid gives off vapor that a spark can light, so a blanket is not enough: move it beyond 35 ft.",
      "safe2_fp_no_watch": "Place the fire watch inside the 35-ft zone, but at least 5 ft from the arc, so they can see where sparks land.",
