      "tech2_dec_intro": "Every box of electrodes or spool of wire carries an AWS classification. Type one and see what each part means.",
      "tech2_dec_j": "Meets the impact-toughness test at -40 °F (-40 °C).",
      "tech2_dec_k_alloy": "Alloy filler metal",
