      "dx_emperor_angelfish_behavior": "Juveniles have blue-and-white rings that change into the adult's yellow-and-blue stripes.",
      "dx_emperor_angelfish_diet": "Feeds mainly on attached sponges and tunicates among the reef's crevices.",
      "dx_emperor_angelfish_habitat": "Clear lagoons, reef channels and seaward reefs with rich coral growth and ledges.",
      "dx_emperor_angelfish_observe": "Check the dark face mask and stripes, and compare the adult pattern with the juvenile description.",
      "dx_empty_saved": "Open a species profile and choose Save this species to keep it here.",
      "dx_empty_saved_title": "Keep your favorites close.",
