      "ex_sound_damaged": "On this damaged reef you hear fewer shrimp snaps and fewer kinds of fish calls. When scientists played healthy reef sounds on damaged patches, twice as many young fish moved in. Sound alone cannot fix a reef, but with reef repair it may speed recovery.",
