      "fig_gr_young": "Young corals need open space",
      "fig_hb_aria": "A claim and its tests. The inventors of Biorock, steel frames with a gentle electric current, report that corals grow faster and survive heat better. Careful tests with fair comparisons in Australia, Kenya and the Philippines mostly found no lasting benefit, and in one case found harm. A fair test compares frames with and without the current, with everything else the same. Good science means checking big claims with fair tests.",
      "fig_hb_check": "Good science checks big claims with fair tests.",
      "fig_hb_claim": "The claim",
