      "fig_hb_without": "without it",
      "fig_hf_aria": "Parts of the Great Barrier Reef in 2022 and 2024. In 2022 they had their highest coral cover in 36 years, much of it fast-growing branching and table corals. In 2024 heat, cyclones and starfish caused the largest one-year drops on record. Recovery is real, and it lasts longest when heatwaves ease.",
      "fig_hf_causes": "after heat, cyclones and starfish",
      "fig_hf_drop": "largest one-year drops on record",
      "fig_hf_ease": "Recovery is real, and it lasts longest when heatwaves ease.",
