      "fig_hf_high": "highest coral cover in 36 years",
      "fig_hf_where": "Parts of the Great Barrier Reef",
      "fig_hg_area": "Most projects cover about a classroom or two.",
      "fig_hg_aria": "Coral gardening in three steps. Small pieces of coral hang on a coral tree nursery, held up off the sand. They grow bigger. Divers plant them on a damaged reef. About two out of three planted corals survive in a typical project, and most projects cover about a classroom or two.",
      "fig_hg_grow": "They grow",
