      "fig_hl_spawn": "big enough to spawn",
      "fig_hl_tents": "Net tents",
      "fig_hr_aria": "A fished area beside a large, old, well-enforced no-take reserve. The reserve holds about five times the biomass of large fish, and its grazing fish keep seaweed down so young corals can grow. Reserves cannot stop bleaching, but they can help reefs bounce back afterwards.",
      "fig_hr_biomass": "Large fish (biomass)",
