      "fig_ht_aria": "A Reef Ball, a hollow concrete dome with holes, and a shipwreck, with fish gathered around them. Fish gather quickly. Whether these structures create new fish or mostly gather fish that already lived nearby is still being studied. Studies of Reef Balls have not found that they help young corals survive or grow better.",
