      "src_footer": "Butterfly Habitat Lab · Local habitat exploration. Find the long-distance monarch journey in Animal Migration Lab.",
      "src_link_mjv_butterfly_senses": "Monarch Joint Venture · Butterfly senses (tasting with feet)",
